    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-17" id="fn-17" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The allowance for funds used during construction (AFUDC) computation is not based on Guardian Pipeline's (GPL) financial statement balances. The actual AFUDC calculation is based on the cost of debt, capital structure, forecasted short-term borrowings, and average forecasted CWIP balances of DT Midstream, Inc. The cost rate of common equity is the most recent rate granted for common equity in an GPL proceeding.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
